#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:5
#: 30116f999853433e8a14c97c0b82b4b1
msgid "Analog Airspeed Sensors"
msgstr "模拟空速传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:7
#: dc464fbad5714e508acfd89c6098cb8a
msgid ""
"Analog airspeed sensors are becoming hard to obtain, since digital sensors "
"are now as inexpensive and much more accurate and stable. Use of a digital "
"airspeed sensor, versus an analog sensor is highly recommended."
msgstr "模拟空速传感器越来越难以购买，因为数字传感器现在同样廉价，但精度和稳定性更高。强烈建议使用数字空速传感器而非模拟传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:9
#: f36d9922f9644c1c96aff9e67627e8ec
msgid ""
"The way this airspeed sensor works is that the top tube is “active” "
"(measures air pressure from the pitot tube that is open at the front and has"
" air driven into it by airspeed) and the bottom one is “static” (measures "
"ambient air pressure from tube with intakes on the side)."
msgstr ""
"该空速传感器的工作原理是：顶部管为「动压」管（测量皮托管的气压，皮托管前端开口，由空速将气流压入），底部管为「静压」管（通过侧面进气口测量环境气压）。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:11
#: 5df659db3d084c0e8c8467827d8aae2d
msgid ""
"Connect the active sensor port using silicon tube to the straight tube "
"exiting from the rear of the pitot tube. The angled tube is the static part "
"connecting to the static port of the sensor (the port on the sensor closest "
"to the PCB)"
msgstr "使用硅胶管将动压传感器端口连接到从皮托管后端直出的管。倾斜管为静压部分，连接到传感器的静压端口（传感器上靠近 PCB 的端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:13
#: e1384c93cf3f4670a5076346c6415f68
msgid "Set the :ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` to 1."
msgstr "将 :ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` 设为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:16
#: 8eb9a59524ee4970a741adf09bee5178
msgid "PX4/Pixhawk Analog Airspeed Pin and Wiring"
msgstr "PX4/Pixhawk 模拟空速引脚与接线"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:18
#: 76172f3feb0b4028aa61ec99a529272c
msgid "For the PX4"
msgstr "对于 PX4"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:20
#: 96ebbbf34b6348988f74d4147fbcc846
msgid "Hardware PIN 11 is available on the PX4 for airspeed use."
msgstr "PX4 上的硬件引脚 11 可用于空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:21
#: 3c33035217c54b3fa47b3e11dfd8a88e
msgid ""
"The \"airspeed\" pin 11 is located on a 3 pin DF13 connector on the PX4IO "
"board but is directly connected to the ADC on the PX4FMU."
msgstr "「空速」引脚 11 位于 PX4IO 板上的一个 3 针 DF13 接口上，但直接连接到 PX4FMU 上的 ADC。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:23
#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:45
#: 279b9949b9ab4b729605558ceaf8741f dd2cfc7944ed4928b2d92ac107f29efa
msgid ""
"This pin can take voltages up to 6.6V (it has an internal voltage divider)."
msgstr "该引脚可承受高达 6.6V 的电压（内置分压器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:25
#: 2b7ada1f0da44a278cb7714480aa52ab
msgid ""
"The FMU-Pres (air pressure) 3 pin connector is on the end of the PX4IO board"
" opposite the power in connector."
msgstr "FMU-Pres（气压）3 针接口位于 PX4IO 板电源输入接口的对侧端。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:28
#: 2fd8930b4cd04e0dba3fd5b6ec3486c8
msgid ""
"Wire the airspeed sensor's signal wire to pin 2 (the center pin) of the FMU-"
"PRES connector."
msgstr "将空速传感器的信号线连接到 FMU-PRES 接口的引脚 2（中间引脚）。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:30
#: 6d16e2089d61458fb9ddbdf62deea00d
msgid ""
"Wire pin 1 (towards the center of the board) to the sensors VCC (5 volts) "
"input."
msgstr "将引脚 1（靠近板中心一侧）连接到传感器的 VCC（5V）输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:32
#: f407161f47ee4251b954825adf16771f
msgid ""
"Wire pin 3 (nearest the edge of the board) to the airspeed sensors ground."
msgstr "将引脚 3（靠近板边缘一侧）连接到空速传感器的地线。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:35
#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:57
#: 18e0f3cc46ef48b1bd3438a3781ddfce 9addea89d6d043b68d1b7a39afe77eca
msgid ""
"Assign the airspeed sensor to an appropriate \"PIN\" in Mission Planner - "
"Configuration - Advanced Params - Adv Parameter List."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner - Configuration - Advanced Params - Adv Parameter List "
"中，将空速传感器分配到合适的 「PIN」。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:38
#: 3ee3694ee24a4fd88bf909bcc0c4e01b
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` parameter to 11 in the Advanced "
"Parameter List and select \"Write Parameters\"."
msgstr ""
"在高级参数列表中将 :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` 参数设为 11，并选择 「Write Parameters」。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:41
#: 91721fec07894398a4c6be8482e46ba5
msgid "For the Pixhawk"
msgstr "对于 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:43
#: 7ef482eeff214365a41596a3800147c6
msgid ""
"The \"airspeed\" pin 15 is located on a 3 pin DF13 connector on the Pixhawk "
"board."
msgstr "「空速」引脚 15 位于 Pixhawk 板上的一个 3 针 DF13 接口上。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:47
#: b80155afee6d4429a446992affb3e70e
msgid ""
"The air pressure connector (labeled ADC 6.6V) is a 3 pin connector on the "
"top right of the Pixhawk."
msgstr "气压接口（标记为 ADC 6.6V）是位于 Pixhawk 右上角的 3 针接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:50
#: 4bf6aaee6f9646d286be4f6e1c55fdaf
msgid ""
"Wire the airspeed sensor's signal wire to pin 2 (the center pin) of the "
"connector."
msgstr "将空速传感器的信号线连接到接口的引脚 2（中间引脚）。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:52
#: 32a5f6e63cfa41d798ae4e1e73521a8d
msgid ""
"Wire pin 1 (towards the center of the board) to the sensor's VCC (5 volts) "
"input."
msgstr "将引脚 1（靠近板中心一侧）连接到传感器的 VCC（5V）输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:54
#: 012f864430fc44f6bfcd680da8e7c2b3
msgid ""
"Wire pin 3 (nearest the edge of the board) to the airspeed sensor's ground."
msgstr "将引脚 3（靠近板边缘一侧）连接到空速传感器的地线。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:60
#: 2fd043c75358468d919f695f2b102b57
msgid ""
"For Pixhawk v1, set the :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` parameter to 15 in the "
"Advanced Parameter List and select \"Write Parameters\"."
msgstr ""
"对于 Pixhawk v1，在高级参数列表中将 :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` 参数设为 15，并选择 「Write "
"Parameters」。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:62
#: 56575a158b954066ac2f6cd120ace9d6
msgid ""
"For Pixhawk v4, set the :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` parameter to 4 in the "
"Advanced Parameter List and select \"Write Parameters\"."
msgstr ""
"对于 Pixhawk v4，在高级参数列表中将 :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` 参数设为 4，并选择 「Write "
"Parameters」。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:65
#: dceb5b55eb5548818259dd4f65fd7069
msgid "For other  autopilots:"
msgstr "对于其他飞控："

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:67
#: cf3d23ce98184386a927cd033430c69a
msgid ""
"Many have an analog RSSI input pin that can serve as the analog airspeed "
"sensor input."
msgstr "许多飞控具有模拟 RSSI 输入引脚，可用作模拟空速传感器输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:69
#: bf25e278d4db47429f242b17c1949633
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Most analog sensors output a signal from 0 to 5V, but most RSSI inputs are "
"3.3V maximum. If you will never exceed ~60% of the sensor's maximum speed "
"output (normally ~ 200mph for 5V), you will not exceed that rating. However,"
" if you might or just want to be absolutely safe, you can use a 2:1 "
"resistive voltage divider on the signal before applying to the autopilot "
"RSSI input pin."
msgstr ""
"大多数模拟传感器输出 0 到 5V 的信号，但大多数 RSSI 输入的最大耐压为 3.3V。如果您永远不会超过传感器最大速度输出的约 60%（通常 5V"
" 对应约 200mph），则不会超过该额定值。但如果可能超过，或只是想绝对安全，可以在将信号接入飞控 RSSI 输入引脚前，在信号线上使用 2:1 "
"阻性分压器。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:72
#: d81d2154fe05435c8a371fdb14714895
msgid ""
"Once you have the airspeed sensor connected, you can use it to control "
"aircraft speed in auto modes. Change the \"Cruise\" setting in the Tuning "
"screen of either APM Planner (shown) or Mission Planner:"
msgstr ""
"连接好空速传感器后，即可在自动模式下用其控制飞机速度。在 APM Planner（如图）或 Mission Planner "
"的调参界面中更改「Cruise」设置："

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:80
#: 9d3e025e7ea34c62921b3e33ae0482ef
msgid "Using a different pin for the airspeed sensor"
msgstr "为空速传感器使用不同引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:82
#: b3ef76a33c5740d5b11a89005e31c3b5
msgid ""
"To assign the airspeed sensor to a specific pin, hook up your autopilot to "
"your PC via USB. Start Mission Planner and select the **Connect** button on "
"the upper right of the page."
msgstr ""
"要将空速传感器分配到特定引脚，请通过 USB 将飞控连接到电脑。启动 Mission Planner，点击页面右上角的 **Connect** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:84
#: df39ed12e8e1405dac9ee2ed91597ca8
msgid ""
"Select the *Configuration* tab then **Advanced Params** and then the **Adv "
"Parameter List**. Scroll down the list to the :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` "
"parameter and select the pin you wish to use."
msgstr ""
"选择 *Configuration* 选项卡，然后依次选择 **Advanced Params** 和 **Adv Parameter "
"List**。在列表中滚动找到 :ref:`ARSPD_PIN <ARSPD_PIN>` 参数，选择您希望使用的引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:88
#: d71bf009f036477a8f299be932abac75
msgid "Set this to 0..9 for the APM2 analog pins."
msgstr "对于 APM2 模拟引脚，设置为 0..9。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:89
#: 982f87bdfe184ffa8149c121db4290f3
msgid ""
"Set to 64 on an APM1 for the dedicated airspeed port on the end of the "
"board."
msgstr "对于 APM1，设为 64，对应板端专用空速端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:91
#: e3b5154ff2c742cc97cbc60d152f73e0
msgid "Set to 11 on PX4 for the analog airspeed port."
msgstr "对于 PX4，设为 11，对应模拟空速端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:92
#: 1fee94877eb049fe9d48a87161ea3f76
msgid "Set to 65 on the PX4 for an I2C airspeed sensor."
msgstr "对于 PX4 上的 I2C 空速传感器，设为 65。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:93
#: 96f5de3f05a848aa97abf9531f79ff0d
msgid ""
"Set to the listed RSSI pin in other board's :ref:`documentation<common-"
"autopilots>`,often it is pin 0."
msgstr "对于其他板卡，设为对应板卡 :ref:`文档<common-autopilots>` 中列出的 RSSI 引脚，通常为引脚 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:96
#: 83d41add28a5448ba87a178dc104e28c
msgid "After you have selected the pin, select the \"Update Parameters\" tab and"
msgstr "选择引脚后，点击 「Update Parameters」 选项卡，然后"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:96
#: 52f06ac563e44bf4b5e16142622da1c8
msgid "close *Mission Planner*."
msgstr "关闭 *Mission Planner*。"

#: ../../source/docs/analog-airspeed-sensors.rst:98
#: b2c2d2565899489081692c38ca7d1f4b
msgid ""
"Additional information on setting the airspeed sensor pin can be :ref:`found"
" here <ARSPD_PIN>`."
msgstr "有关设置空速传感器引脚的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <ARSPD_PIN>`。"
